'''Woodlands Area 4''' is the fourth stage in [[Hidden Forest of Gapra]]. Once completed for the first time, it unlocks [[The Strongest Behemoth|Affliction in the Forest]], which must be cleared in order to access [[Deep Jungle Area 5]].

