==Battleground==
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
With this level featuring Casaurian Ahirujo, it is vital to have a strong anti-Red unit. With an anti-Red cat tanking Ahirujo, your main things to look out for are the Wild Doges and Angelic Gories. Carefully manage your cash and use Area Attackers like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to deal with them. Once both Angelic Gories are down, you're free to clean up the stage. If you find this stage difficult, it may be a good idea to try [[Badlands Area 2]], as your units may be better equipped to handle that stage.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish]]: Crazed Fish is almost vital to beat this stage. A level 20 Crazed Whale is able to tank a full barrage of Ahirujo hits without getting knocked back, which greatly reduces the difficulty of this level.
*[[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]]: A strong anti-Red tank for Ahirujo. Has double the health in True Form, which increases its effectiveness and allows it to survive more attacks from non-Red enemies.
*[[Dancing Flasher Cat]]: Strong Single Attacker for Wild Doge.
*[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]]: Anti-Angel meatshield able to hold off the Angel enemies in this stage. In True Form, he gains enough health to survive a hit from Wild Doges.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
''Note that Ahirujo is immune to Slow, Freeze, and Surge, meaning most anti-red Crowd Controller Ubers aren't going to do much here.''

*Backliner Ubers in general help considerably here. If they happen to be [[Strong]] or deal [[Massive Damage]] against either Red or Angel, even better.
*Anti-Red tanker Ubers like [[Sea Maiden Ruri (Uber Rare Cat)|Sea Maiden Ruri]] or [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine]] help to tank Ahirujo for long periods of time.

